usage: local_candidate_demo.py [-h] --data-dir DATA_DIR [--port PORT]
                               {prepare,prepare-pa,verify,serve}

Explicit synthetic local demo; never the ordinary PostgreSQL launcher. Uses
the existing loopback/Store(test_only=True)/MockTransport fixture pattern. No
.env discovery, DSN, credential, provider URL, automatic worker or live mode.
Prepare keeps its new directory for a later, separate-process read-only
verify.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,prepare-pa,verify,serve}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR
  --port PORT           serve only; loopback, 0 for dynamic port
